stdout | tests/whyfail.test.ts > S: WHY I1 fails — legal-stop capacity, and its dependence on deadlock-freedom > S2: when a robot at an illegal cell has no free neighbour, it CANNOT move — prove it
S2 target 6,4 isLegalStop=false; traversable neighbours: 6,3 6,5 5,4 7,4
